# Fresh app process, same isolated sealed profile and exact native binary.
settle 90
ui-zoom 1
assert snap practice-saved == true
assert snap practice-save-problem == false
assert snap set-cards == 5
assert snap rehearsal-running == false
assert snap p5a-card-label == Output PCM refusal
assert snap p5a-card-hold == manual
act p5a-verify-final
act p5a-save-reopened
capture 01_exact_sealed_timing_reopen
log P5a timing admission fresh-process reopen complete
